================================================================================
Third-party software and models
================================================================================

The components below are used by this project. Items marked "runtime" are not
vendored in this repository; they are downloaded when you run embedding features
(for example `vitiligo embed run` or `vitiligo serve` with embedding prewarm).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. fastembed (Python dependency)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project:   https://github.com/qdrant/fastembed
   License:   Apache License 2.0
   Copyright: Qdrant (see upstream LICENSE)
   Role:      ONNX-based text embedding inference library

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (default embedding model, runtime)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project:   https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
   License:   MIT License (BAAI / FlagEmbedding model terms)
   Role:      Default model for semantic search (`BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5`, 384-dim)
   Note:      Weights are fetched into the local fastembed cache on first use.
              They are not committed to this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. ONNX Runtime (transitive dependency via fastembed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project:   https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
   License:   MIT License
   Role:      ONNX model inference runtime

================================================================================
Upstream public data
================================================================================

Ingested corpus records (literature, trial registries, priors, and similar) are
sourced from third-party public databases. Each source remains subject to its
provider's terms of use. This repository does not ship the full built corpus in
git; see `docs/engine.md` for how to build or obtain `vitiligo.db`.

================================================================================
Optional cloud API (not bundled)
================================================================================

The Ask and Hypothesize features may call the Anthropic Messages API when
`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is configured on the server. That service is not part of
this distribution; use is governed by Anthropic's terms at
https://www.anthropic.com/legal.
